        prompts: {
          human: "Skin (or 'Georgia Skin') is a legendary high-stakes gambling game from the American South. It is a banking game, but not in the traditional sense where the bank has an edge; the edge comes purely from chance, nerve, and 'side bets'. Cards are dealt from a shoe one by one. Players bet on their card being matched by a card from the deck. If your card is matched (falls), you lose. The last card standing ('The Skin') is the winner unless all bets are resolved earlier. It is famous for its slow, tension-filled reveal ('Skinning').",
